{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flight Runner Universe</strong> is a chaotic multiplayer arena game blending aerial combat, vehicular mayhem, and wild game modes into one explosive experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In <strong>Battle Royale</strong>, take to the skies and clash on a gravity-warped battlefield. With multiple lives and point-based scoring, every elimination brings you closer to ultimate victory. Outmaneuver, outgun, and outlast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Beat-em-up Soccer</strong>, enter the stadium where goals and knockouts both count. Use weapons, vehicles, and flight powers to brawl your way to victory in the most intense match you've ever played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Racing Mode</strong>, blaze through roads and tracks scattered across the map. Blast your way to the finish using flight boosts and tactical shortcuts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your mode. Pick your playstyle. <strong>Master the skies and dominate the arena.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1146710?t=1745986669","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1146710/4cf346b3d9e1b5dd8d745e0482208a3ed27f802c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745986669","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1146710/200aada395662e7c4bf4d75633c2ef51a13c9653/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745986669","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1146710/200aada395662e7c4bf4d75633c2ef51a13c9653/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745986669","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flight Runner Universe</strong> is a chaotic multiplayer arena game blending aerial combat, vehicular mayhem, and wild game modes into one explosive experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In <strong>Battle Royale</strong>, take to the skies and clash on a gravity-warped battlefield. With multiple lives and point-based scoring, every elimination brings you closer to ultimate victory. Outmaneuver, outgun, and outlast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Beat-em-up Soccer</strong>, enter the stadium where goals and knockouts both count. Use weapons, vehicles, and flight powers to brawl your way to victory in the most intense match you've ever played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Racing Mode</strong>, blaze through roads and tracks scattered across the map. Blast your way to the finish using flight boosts and tactical shortcuts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your mode. Pick your playstyle. <strong>Master the skies and dominate the arena.</strong></p>","developers":["Peter Tan"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1146710/45a165d15a39380dba17bb7c1e98c980d8fd35a4/header.jpg?t=1745986669","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133084,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133084/movie480.mp4?t=1745974178","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133084/movie_max.mp4?t=1745974178"},"name":"Flight Runner Universe - Promo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133084/c11967abd3c12afc01a38a0c29647dca8912e767/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745974178","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25713